```catala
declaration scope A:
    input x content money
    output o content integer

scope A:
    definition o equals 0
    exception definition o under condition - $0.1 < x and x < $0 consequence equals 5
    exception definition o under condition $0 < x and x < $1 consequence equals 4
    exception definition o under condition $1 < x and x < $3 consequence equals 3
    exception definition o under condition $3 < x and x < $20 consequence equals 2
    exception definition o under condition x > $150 consequence equals 1
```

